# Issue #63 physical data-plane throughput Spike — build + runtime + physical
# evidence output. Authored source is versioned:
#   coordinator/src/**, winpe-runner/src/**, winpe-runner/build.rs,
#   stage2-engine/src/**, stage2-probe/src/**, stage2-probe/build.rs,
#   stage2-harness/src/**, stage3-harness/src/**, */Cargo.toml, */Cargo.lock,
#   stage1/**, stage2/**, stage3/**, README.md, this .gitignore.
# Everything below is regenerable, runtime, or physical-run output.
target/
evidence/
# Stage-3 harness runtime: persisted self-signed leaf, chunk store, fingerprint.
runtime-stage3/
*.log
*.ndjson
# Generated / cross-built executables (rebuilt from source, staged at run time).
*.exe
*.pdb
# Stage 1 carries NO credential/key/token. Stage 3 mints ONE short-TTL
# first-contact credential per run into the git-ignored evidence dir. Never
# commit any key/credential material.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.der
*.pkcs8
*.cred
